[Sport / Action]: {Paragliding, freediving, mountain biking, rock climbing...}
[Environment]: {Sky, ocean, forest, cliffs, or another immersive setting}
[Main Headline]: {Your bold English title}
[Typography Surface]: {Inflated fabric, waterline, tree trunks, overhanging rock...}
[Perspective Effect]: {Surface curvature, refraction, multi-plane alignment, inverted perspective...}
[Brand / Color Palette]: {Custom branding and contrasting colors}

Create a cinematic 9:16 adventure sports poster where gigantic typography becomes part of the physical environment.

Capture a professional athlete in a dramatic yet believable action pose. Emphasize realistic anatomy, authentic equipment, natural lighting, and the immense scale of the surrounding landscape.

Design oversized, ultra-bold English typography that interacts directly with the chosen surface. Letters may bend across inflated fabric, refract through water, align across objects at different depths, or stretch along an inverted rock surface.

Use accurate perspective, realistic occlusion, and material-specific distortion. The typography should feel integrated into the scene while remaining clearly readable.

Build a powerful visual hierarchy through scale contrast, dynamic composition, and carefully controlled colors.

Include a compact editorial system with top branding, small project information, vertical side labels, and a meaningful bottom tagline.

Premium outdoor campaign photography, immersive depth, natural textures, and bold visual experimentation.

Avoid floating 3D letters, random distortions, incorrect anatomy, excessive effects, and generic placeholder text.

