[Sport / Action]: {Surfing, trail running, cliff diving, ice climbing...}
[Environment]: {Describe the natural landscape and its dominant material}
[Main Headline]: {Your bold English title}
[Typography Effect]: {Wave wrapping, geological fractures, waterfall distortion, ice refraction...}
[Color Palette]: {Dominant, contrasting, and accent colors}
[Brand / Tagline]: {Custom brand name and meaningful slogan}

Create a stunning 9:16 vertical sports campaign poster combining photorealistic action photography with monumental spatial perspective typography.

Capture an athlete in a powerful mid-action moment within a breathtaking natural environment. Use dramatic wide-angle perspective, realistic lighting, authentic textures, and strong foreground-to-background depth.

Integrate enormous, ultra-bold sans-serif lettering directly into the landscape. Let the typography follow the natural geometry of waves, rocks, waterfalls, or ice, using exaggerated foreshortening, perspective stretching, and the selected environmental distortion.

Allow water, rock edges, spray, or translucent materials to naturally overlap the letters, creating believable depth and physical interaction.

Add refined editorial details: a brand name at the top, small project information, vertical side text, and a short tagline at the bottom.

Keep the headline dominant, correctly spelled, and readable despite the distortion.

Cinematic sports photography, striking scale, bold contrast, and premium campaign aesthetics. Avoid flat text overlays, excessive CGI, random lettering, and unnecessary decorations.

